[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011072038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116982#issuecomment-4011072038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116982","id":4011072038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vFBom","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T11:03:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T11:05:08Z","body":"`MAX_INSTANCE_UNIFORM_INDICES` on its own isn't related to any hardware limit, since it's only used for reserving space from the existing buffer. So the description about errors on mobile doesn't sound accurate. The setting to worry about is `rendering/limits/global_shader_variables/buffer_size` instead.\r\n\r\nHowever, since it's a storage buffer, it should still be fine, since all Vulkan devices support storage buffers with a size of at least 128 MB: https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/displaydevicelimit.php?name=maxStorageBufferRange&platform=all\r\n\r\nI don't know about the other APIs but D3D12 also supports them up to GBs.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011072038/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4013432206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116982#issuecomment-4013432206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116982","id":4013432206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vOB2O","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T18:47:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T18:47:22Z","body":"Fixed the incorrect note about mobile in the class reference.\r\n\r\n> The setting to worry about is `rendering/limits/global_shader_variables/buffer_size` instead.\r\n\r\nIs it also used for per-instance uniforms? If so, is the buffer size budget shared with global uniforms?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"http